# --- Privacy: what the program collects about its user never goes into git -----------------------
# (Checkpoints commit the whole tree, so anything not ignored here WILL be committed.)
# Logs of real requests, feedback and trajectories used for local Leeth training:
src/leeth/data/leeth_feedback*.jsonl
src/leeth/data/leeth_trajectories*.jsonl
src/leeth/data/shadow_mined*.jsonl
src/micromodels/data/training_pairs.jsonl
src/micromodels/data/live_dataset.jsonl
src/micromodels/data/active_learning_queue.jsonl
scripts/_flywheel_verdicts.json
# Trained weights: local artifacts, far over the 100 MB limit of a git host
src/leeth/data/leeth_best*.pt
src/leeth/data/leeth_pretrained.pt
src/leeth/data/leeth_candidate*.pt
src/leeth/data_400m/*.onnx
src/leeth/data_400m/*.onnx.data
